# sys-chatter: Chatter from the party menu (decomp FieldMoves_CheckChatter, FieldMoves_ChatterTask: script
# RECORD_CHATOT_CRY 0 with the party slot). The script draws the Chatot preview from its party slot and asks it to
# learn a saying. Recording needs the DS microphone, which the browser game does not use, so TryRecordChatotCry
# fails as on a DS whose recording does not start (a logged stub): "…failed to learn…", "Want to try again?", NO.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_CHATOT 20 platinum:MOVE_CHATTER
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_203 246 749 right
+0 wild flee
until idle
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:0
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap menu:1
until app none
until message 600
+0 assert text platinum:RecordChatotCry_Text_PressAOrBThenSpeak 0
+1 press a
+1 release a
until message 600
+0 assert text platinum:RecordChatotCry_Text_ChatotFailedToLearnSaying 0 0=platinum:SPECIES_CHATOT
+1 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until yesno 600
+0 assert text platinum:RecordChatotCry_Text_WantToTryAgain 0
+1 press b
+1 release b
until idle
